Air strikes by a single air wing aimed at striking a specific target.

[l_english.tooltip_raid_category_nuclear_raids]
§HNuclear raids§!
Strikes carried out by strategic bombers or ballistic missiles carrying nuclear weapons.

[l_english.tooltip_raid_category_paratrooper_raids]
§HParatrooper raids§!
Small scale raids performed by Paradropping special forces dropping behind enemy lines, to conduct dangerous sabotage missions.

